Package: macrox
Title: Record and Replay PDF Table Extraction Workflows
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("First", "Last", email = "you@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Record interactive PDF table extraction steps as replayable macros.
    Supports table selection by page index, bounding box, or fuzzy label matching.
    Handles multi-row headers, column renaming, type casting, and row filtering.
    Macros are saved as YAML and can be replayed against any structurally similar PDF.
